# Project Structure

Each directory contains a README.md with detailed documentation.

```
.
├── agents/           # Learning algorithms (PPO, MC-FD gradient solver)
│                     See [agents/README.md](mdc:agents/README.md)
├── config/           # Experiment configurations
│                     [one_stage_two_players.py](mdc:config/one_stage_two_players.py) - Primary config
│                     [one_stage_three_players.py](mdc:config/one_stage_three_players.py)
│                     [two_stage_two_players.py](mdc:config/two_stage_two_players.py)
│                     [asymmetric_cost_two_players.py](mdc:config/asymmetric_cost_two_players.py)
│                     [asymmetric_ability_two_players.py](mdc:config/asymmetric_ability_two_players.py)
├── docs/             # Documentation hub
│   ├── guides/       # User guides (PPO defaults, plotting, asymmetric init)
│   ├── technical/    # Implementation docs, audit reports
│   └── archive/      # Legacy materials (Word docs, old code)
├── envs/             # Game environments
│                     See [envs/README.md](mdc:envs/README.md)
├── paper_artifacts/  # Paper figure/table generation pipeline
│                     See [paper_artifacts/README.md](mdc:paper_artifacts/README.md)
├── paper_out/        # Generated paper outputs (figures, tables, data)
├── results/          # Experiment outputs
│   ├── convergence_history/  # JSON training data
│   └── convergence_plots/    # Generated plots
├── run/              # Experiment entry points
│                     [run_two_players.py](mdc:run/run_two_players.py) - Primary entry point
│                     [run_mcfd.py](mdc:run/run_mcfd.py) - MC-FD solver
│                     [run_ppo_custom_params.py](mdc:run/run_ppo_custom_params.py) - Custom sweeps
├── tools/            # Analysis and diagnostic scripts
│                     plot_convergence.py, verify_rollout_modes.py, etc.
└── utils/            # Core utility modules (prob, theory, eval, logger)
                      See [utils/README.md](mdc:utils/README.md)
```

## Key Entry Points

- **Run experiments**: `python run/run_two_players.py --method ppo --q 25 --episodes 2048000`
- **Generate plots**: `python tools/plot_convergence_detailed.py`
- **Generate paper artifacts**: `python -m paper_artifacts make_all`

## Results Output

- Convergence JSON: `results/convergence_history/{method}_q{q}_seed{seed}_{ablation}_convergence.json`
- Results CSV: `results/one_stage_two_players_v2.csv`
